### Area 2: tasks, an order's steps, the SPR approval page and reminders.
### Sign in first (auth.http). Every answer here is mock data and says so in
### meta.mock, except the document configuration. The POST requests check and
### answer "applied": false: they change nothing until the workflow engine exists.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@csrf = paste the op_csrf cookie value here after signing in

### The caller's own task inbox (a role with an inbox). Add ?overdue=true for overdue only.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/tasks?page=1&pageSize=25

### Another role's inbox. Needs workflows.inboxes.any (Management and Auditor).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/inboxes/WAREHOUSE/tasks

### Reminders, for the caller's role or another role's.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/reminders
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/inboxes/LOGISTICS/reminders

### An order's steps, timeline and payment. Sample orders are SO-0001 to SO-0010.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/orders/SO-0004/flow

### Confirm a payment with its type. Finance only. Checked, not stored.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/orders/SO-0004/payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{ "paymentType": "PREPAYMENT", "amount": "1250.00", "currencyCode": "USD", "reference": "TT-0004", "paidOn": "2026-11-02" }

### An SPR with its suggested fields, the stock figures and the approver's setup.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/sprs/SPR-20261102-0001

### Approve or reject with a comment. Approver only. Checked, nothing changed.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/sprs/SPR-20261102-0001/approve
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{ "comment": "Within my limit." }

### A comment is required: this one is refused with VALIDATION_FAILED.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/sprs/SPR-20261102-0001/reject
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{ "comment": "" }

### Field settings and defaults for each document type, read from the table.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/document-config
